    "baseline_contract": [
      "The candidate library is a manufactured occupancy/B-factor grid, not a crystallographic refinement benchmark.",
      "The observation is generated from an off-grid parameter state so no library member exactly generates the data.",
      "The ACFO workflow uses the 8008-atom unit cell plus an exact finite-lattice factor, whereas FINUFFT evaluates the full 216216-atom repeated crystal.",
